# MAYAtoUnity generated/imported Maya node components intentionally preserve Maya attribute names.
# Many Maya nodes expose attributes such as `enabled`, `camera`, `particleSystem`, and `runInEditMode`.
# In Unity MonoBehaviour-derived components those names can hide inherited Unity members and produce CS0108 warnings.
# These generated preservation fields are not Unity API overrides; suppress this warning for this importer assembly scope.
-nowarn:0108
